# Version control & tooling
**/.git
**/.github
**/.turbo
**/dist-turbo
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Dependencies & build outputs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
